  "_comment": "Scene type engine settings - read by compiler/modes.py and the editor (Settings > Engine). Each setting is one int16 in the engine's ModeSettings (engine/include/modes.h), in this order. Units: speed = px per frame, accel = px per frame per frame (both stored x256), frames/pixels/count = whole numbers, bool = 0/1, button = an INPUT_* mask, choice = the option's index.",
